{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is an isosceles trapezoid with side lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4cf8ce9700010e8620661cc3e03c537475094c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=BC=5$\" width=\"115\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b44beb78e8be18179bfb7fe6b3424e7fb1aef32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5171e40da67256dd4b44e1b42bb850cd9c0dfd92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />. The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe61d9d20e070fbd02e581eca23118337b50ee6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DF}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of hypotenuse <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699784c989c3db382520e6f92819e062d239f504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> in the right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9e8b2c23e0545ef6de81f0ea578173e9ab7a64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEF$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/9/b299e6b00b679a9c7d02f611d2393f0fccb1311c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF=$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc7f60f9d88489edea67f7e300d24578a88f323.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(150); defaultpen(fontsize(10)); pair D=origin, A=(3,4), B=(7,4), C=(10,0), E=(14,8), F=(14,0); draw(B--C--F--E--B--A--D--B^^C--D, linewidth(0.7)); dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^E^^F); pair point=(5,3); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, S); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, dir(point--E)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, dir(point--F)); markscalefactor=0.05;  draw(rightanglemark(E,F,D), linewidth(0.7));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"158\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/255504ac2998b611d3b3e647b0da48ad2debc892.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3.25\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3.5\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3.75\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4.0\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/5/d1595e520fb3949b8bcf6677f1451bffdde409d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(150); defaultpen(fontsize(10)); pair D=origin, A=(3,4), B=(7,4), C=(10,0), E=(14,8), F=(14,0); draw(B--C--F--E--B--A--D--B^^C--D, linewidth(0.7)); dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^E^^F); pair point=(5,3); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, S); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, dir(point--E)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, dir(point--F)); markscalefactor=0.05; draw(rightanglemark(E,F,D), linewidth(0.7)); pair X=(3,0), Y=(7,0); draw(A--X^^B--Y,dotted); dot(X^^Y); label(&quot;$X$&quot;, X, S); label(&quot;$Y$&quot;, Y, S); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"158\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the feet of the perpendiculars from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe61d9d20e070fbd02e581eca23118337b50ee6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DF}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" />, respectively. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72fe6ad5d69e9b6abba926003c1aa746acfcc95f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DEF \\sim \\triangle DBY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />, and the sides of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872e3b09425c9659d782119a543dc858aa520a40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DEF$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> are twice as long as those of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cbd09aaab024a5db90c65fbc174cc03e6c5120f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DBY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/0/a506ea7f8bacb5fbb37d1316043abea001da5723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY = AB = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cff285b89300f3f164b7147c57de5ef26cfa8d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DX = YC = \\frac{10-4}{2} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/c/eec5383f0b1349237a9b1fe79e31a2744aa1f425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DY = 4 + 3 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab12c299976d342f30541f9042a168f1f6cdb96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF = 2 \\cdot DY = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"14\" />.  Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/f/91fa280e39d6e79cf91051c4ae573628544592b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF = 14 - 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4.0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"207\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18b2b441f9124f1135556c055367cbc643efcbeb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import geometry; size(150); defaultpen(fontsize(10)); pair D=origin, A=(3,4), B=(7,4), C=(10,0), E=(14,8), F=(14,0); draw(B--C--F--E--B--A--D--B^^C--D, linewidth(0.7)); draw(B--D, StickIntervalMarker(i=1, size=5)); draw(B--F, dotted, StickIntervalMarker(i=1, size=5)); dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^E^^F); pair point=(5,3); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, S); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, dir(point--E)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, dir(point--F)); markscalefactor=0.05; markangle(radius=10, F, D, B); markangle(radius=10, B, F, D); markangle(radius=10, A, B, D); markangle(radius=5, n=2, D, A, B); markangle(radius=5, n=2, F, C, B); draw(rightanglemark(E,F,D), linewidth(0.7));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"158\" />\n</p><p>Draw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa4ad1cf6a0ad719767e1739c9b689debc60142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BF}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699784c989c3db382520e6f92819e062d239f504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3fb3480a7171539d2a158fff09efcd3c6ab1ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = BF = BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"14\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc4a1ecf2193896680e5e73b698d50e779548b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BDF$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc489f4530517409e2d69c0bacbb1ce1cfcd6155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BFD = \\angle BDF = \\angle ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"222\" height=\"14\" />.  Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/4/44487ad1a3a02db259f91377222c2cd35c17960d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = \\angle ABC = \\angle BCF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"188\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddd1dae678db9104f22c751a7bdbac4b76125429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DAB \\cong \\triangle BCF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/298f173dc112f2656a5f2a0a0d972c93af216eea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF = AB = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4.0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"177\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017181301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 251/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2490/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 148/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8214/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.511      1 -total\n 57.65%    7.213      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 39.94%    4.997      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki